## Production concerns

- Keep access tokens short-lived; handle revocation and refresh separately.
- Check object-level ownership in handlers, not just role (avoid broken object-level authorisation).
- Never log tokens; return generic error bodies.
- Prefer an identity provider and gateway for common checks, with in-service authorisation for business rules.

## Likely interviewer extensions

